\par\par \b \uc2 Finance News: Morgan Stanley Mandates Vaccine\b0\par\par\uc2 By Peter Rudegeair \par \uc2 274 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 June 2021\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B10\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  has told its employees they must get Covid-19 vaccines before returning to its New York offices.\par \par \uc2 Staff are required to disclose their vaccination status to the bank by July 1, the Wall Street firm said in a memo to employees. Starting July 12, employees, contingent workers, clients and visitors will be required to confirm they were vaccinated before entering \uc2 Morgan Stanley\uc2  buildings in New York City and Westchester County.\par \par \uc2 Unvaccinated employees will work remotely, a person familiar with the matter said. At a conference last week, Chief Executive \uc2 James Gorman\uc2  said well over 90% of employees in its offices were vaccinated.\par \par \uc2 Companies are pressuring employees to get vaccinated before their offices fully reopen, but few have gone so far as to require it. The \uc2 Equal Employment Opportunity Commission\uc2  last month said U.S. employers can require staffers entering a workplace to be vaccinated against Covid-19, although they must accommodate those who are unvaccinated for disability or religious reasons.\par \par \uc2 Getting workers vaccinated is especially important to Wall Street firms eager to end the work-from-home era.\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan Chase & Co\uc2 . told employees Wednesday they must log into its vaccine-tracker tool by June 30, though they can decline to say if they have been vaccinated. Unvaccinated employees and those who refuse to disclose their status are required to come to the office but must wear masks, observe social-distancing rules and complete a daily health questionnaire.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs Group Inc\uc2 ., which brought thousands of employees back to its Manhattan headquarters, is requiring U.S. employees to disclose whether they got a vaccine.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020210624eh6o0001f\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
