\par\par \uc2 Technology\par \b \uc2 Apple Maps Out Its Return To Offices\b0\par\par\uc2 By Aaron Tilley \par \uc2 289 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 June 2021\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B4\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Apple Inc\uc2 . is telling office staff to prepare to return to the workplace at least most of the time, joining the growing pool of companies adopting hybrid work.\par \par \uc2 Apple Chief Executive \uc2 Tim Cook\uc2 , in an email to staff, told office employees that they are expected to return to their workspace three days a week starting in September. The iPhone maker said it wants most office workers to show up Mondays, Tuesdays and Thursdays, with the option to work remotely on Wednesdays and Fridays.\par \par \uc2 Technology news outlet The Verge earlier reported the back-to-office plans.\par \par \uc2 Apple\uc2  already has gradually been reopening its retail stores around the world. In March, all of its 270 U.S. retail outlets welcomed back shoppers. In his note to employees, Mr. Cook said all stores in other markets would open their doors again by the end of the month.\par \par \uc2 Companies across industries are adopting plans to go back to the office, but many offering staff greater flexibility than pre-pandemic.\par \par \uc2 Alphabet Inc\uc2 .'s \uc2 Google\uc2  last month notified employees of its hybrid work plans, with employees going into an office three days a week and some likely to work remotely permanently. \uc2 Microsoft Corp\uc2 . in March said it was welcoming employees back to its headquarters, while offering them the ability to work from the office or home.\par \par \uc2 Hybrid-work arrangements are becoming not just a way of working for some companies, but in some cases an opportunity, fueling appetite for tools and equipment to facilitate having some employees in the office while others work remotely. \uc2 Zoom Video Communications Inc\uc2 . this week reported surging sales for some of the tools it offers to facilitate hybrid work.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020210604eh640000o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
