\par\par \b \uc2 Banking & Finance: \uc2 Bank of America\uc2 's Hourly Pay To Hit $25\b0\par\par\uc2 By Colin Kellaher and Ben Eisen \par \uc2 309 \uc2 words\par \uc2 19 May 2021\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B12\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bank of America Corp\uc2 . on Tuesday said it plans to raise its hourly minimum wage to $25 by 2025, putting it on track to surpass its big-bank peers during a time of worker shortages across the country.\par \par \uc2 The Charlotte, N.C., banking giant also said it is requiring all of its U.S. vendors to pay employees who are dedicated to the bank at least $15 an hour.\par \par \uc2 The second-largest U.S. lender joins companies including \uc2 Amazon.com Inc\uc2 . and \uc2 McDonald's Corp\uc2 . in saying it will raise pay to attract workers as the economy reopens more fully. Average hourly earnings for private-sector employees rose by 21 cents to $30.17 last month, according to a recent Labor Department report.\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan Chase & Co\uc2 ., the largest U.S. lender, in January raised its minimum hourly base pay to between $16 and $20, depending on the local cost of living. \uc2 Wells Fargo & Co\uc2 . last year raised its pay to between $15 and $20 an hour, also depending on geography. And \uc2 Citigroup Inc\uc2 . raised its base pay to $15 an hour in 2019, though a spokeswoman said its average for hourly U.S. workers is $23.89.\par \par \uc2 In March 2020, \uc2 Bank of America\uc2  raised its minimum hourly wage to $20, a year ahead of plan, after boosting it to $17 an hour in 2019. The bank said it has more than doubled its minimum hourly pay since 2010.\par \par \uc2 President Biden campaigned on a pledge to raise the federal minimum wage to $15 an hour, but a February push by Democrats to include the increase in the $1.9 trillion Covid-19 relief package was unsuccessful. Mr. Biden in late April signed an executive order requiring that federal contractors pay a $15-an-hour minimum wage.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020210519eh5j0001o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
